# STAGING: NAMES read by both profiles (bot and control). Real file: /etc/oposibots/staging/backend.common.env (root:root, 0600).
# Values come from the STAGING Supabase project dashboard straight into this file on the host: never through chat, never the repo,
# never from /etc/oposibots/production or the repository .env (that one points at MAIN with service_role).
#
# FIXED by compose.staging.yaml (environment:, wins over this file; do not set): APP_ENV=staging, SENTRY_ENVIRONMENT=staging,
# METRICS_ENABLED=true, SERVER_PROFILE, JAVA_TOOL_OPTIONS, PROMETHEUS_URL.
# NEVER set: PAYMENTS_SANDBOX_SECRET (exit 78 outside local/test), OPOSICONTROL_ALLOW_DEV_*, OPOSICONTROL_ENABLE_BACKEND_RESTART.
LOG_LEVEL=
SLOW_REQUEST_THRESHOLD_MS=
SUPABASE_URL=
SUPABASE_SECRET_KEY=
SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY=
SUPABASE_BUCKET_EXAM_RESOURCES=
UPSTREAM_CONNECT_TIMEOUT_MS=
UPSTREAM_REQUEST_TIMEOUT_MS=
METRICS_SCRAPE_TOKEN=
SENTRY_DSN=
SENTRY_RELEASE=
SENTRY_TRACES_SAMPLE_RATE=
# Notes (no values):
#  - SUPABASE_URL: https://<STAGING project ref>.supabase.co. ops/deploy/staging/staging-secrets-check.sh refuses the MAIN ref.
#  - SUPABASE_SECRET_KEY (or SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY): the STAGING project's key. One of the two.
#  - METRICS_SCRAPE_TOKEN: new random value; same value as /etc/oposibots/staging/metrics_token (0400).
#  - SENTRY_DSN: empty (disabled) unless a staging DSN exists; SENTRY_RELEASE = image tag.
